  Magic missile does [(XL/2) +1] d6 worth of damage per hit.  

 At XL 14 that's  8 d6, an average of 24 pts of damage per hit.
 At XL 30 that's 16 d6, an average of 48 pts of damage per hit.

  With Int greater than 18 add two more points to the damage, for
an average of 50 at XL 30.


  NB: Those figures are accurate for anyone casting the magic
missile spell, except knights carrying the Magic Mirror of 
Merlin.  

  Knights carrying the MMoM get double those figures, which 
